    "title": "Spain 3-0 Serbia: World Cup 2026 friendly – as it happened",
    "text": "27 Mar 2026 - 22:47 (22:47 GMT)Goodbye for nowSpain put in a commanding 3-0 performance against Serbia as they finalise their preparations ahead of the 2026 World Cup in June.Do join us again soon for more live coverage!27 Mar 2026 - 22:35 (22:35 GMT)Read all about it: Spain-Serbia report is now liveClick here to read our full match report.27 Mar 2026 - 22:20 (22:20 GMT)Climbing the ranks27 Mar 2026 - 22:10 (22:10 GMT)Next up for Al Jazeera SportWe will have more international football for you this coming Tuesday.Some notable matches include Switzerland-Norway, England-Japan and United States-Portugal.27 Mar 2026 - 22:03 (22:03 GMT)Updated European friendlies resultsThere was plenty of action from across the world. Here are some of the latest results: Russia 3-1 Nicaragua Austria 5-1 Ghana Montenegro 2-0 Andorra Greece 0-1 Paraguay England 1-1 Uruguay Netherlands 2-1 Norway Switzerland 3-4 Germany Spain 3-0 Serbia 27 Mar 2026 - 21:56 (21:56 GMT)La Roja cruise to dominant victoryThey were hardly troubled by their opposition today, with Serbia unable to really test Simon.The hosts’ passing, movement and finishing were simply levels above on the night.In the end, they had 12 shots versus Serbia’s two, while also maintaining 71 percent in possession.Oyarzabal stands out with his brace, but special mention goes to Munoz for scoring on his international debut.Full-time: Spain 3-0 Serbia 27 Mar 2026 - 21:51 (21:51 GMT)Full-time: Spain 3-0 SerbiaThe referee ends Serbia’s misery as Spain come away with a 3-0 win.Full-time: Spain 3-0 Serbia 27 Mar 2026 - 21:51 (21:51 GMT)Munoz stoppedHaving already had a taste of goal, the debutant wants another.But this time, his effort from the right side of the box is covered by Milinkovic-Savic.90+1 mins: Spain 3-0 Serbia Sign up for Al JazeeraBreaking News AlertGet real-time breaking news alerts and stay up-to-date with the most important headlines from around the globe.27 Mar 2026 - 21:49 (21:49 GMT)Two minutes addedNot much longer now in this rather one-sided contest.90 mins: Spain 3-0 Serbia 27 Mar 2026 - 21:45 (21:45 GMT)Olmo blocked!Munoz rushes in from the right side. He cuts back a pass to Fornals, who tees it up beautifully for Olmo to attack.With just the keeper he beats, he ends up going high, but Milinkovic-Savic is able to keep it out from close range.85 mins: Spain 3-0 Serbia",
